 elephants"},{"surface":"பெயர்த்து","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்த்து","lemma":"peyarttu","gloss":"again"}],"gloss":"again"},{"surface":"எண்ணின்","parts":[{"text":"எண்ணின்","lemma":"eṇṇiṉ","gloss":"if counted"}],"gloss":"if counted"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விண்","parts":[{"text":"விண்","lemma":"viṇ","gloss":"sky"}],"gloss":"sky"},{"surface":"இவர்","parts":[{"text":"இவர்","lemma":"ivar","gloss":"rising"}],"gloss":"rising"},{"surface":"விசும்பின்","parts":[{"text":"விசும்பு","lemma":"vicumpu","gloss":"heavens"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the heavens"},{"surface":"மீனும்","parts":[{"text":"மீன்","lemma":"mīṉ","gloss":"star"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"stars also"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தண்பெயல்","parts":[{"text":"தண்பெயல்","lemma":"தண்பெயல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உறையும்","parts":[{"text":"உறையும்","lemma":"உறையும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உறையாற்","parts":[{"text":"உறையாற்","lemma":"உறையாற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றாவே","parts":[{"text":"றாவே","lemma":"றாவே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Like crackling bamboo catching fire, running / leaping and prancing, the horse indeed, with flower-like ornaments indeed, / which are like those received by the hair of women wearing shining jewels, / wrapped with garlands of many strands of fragrant lemon-grass, / on the curved arm of the small lute fashioned with delicate melody, / presented to the bards who stroke the strings with their hands, / in the small village of dry wasteland of poor nature, / the young warrior who destroys those who look at him, urging his horse, / if one counts again the male elephants killed with his spear, / the stars of the heavens rising in the sky / and the drops of cool rain are not sufficient to equal them indeed.","translation":"Running like crackling bamboo catching fire, leaping and prancing is his horse, adorned with flower-like ornaments. These ornaments resemble the fragrant garlands of many-stranded lemon-grass worn in the hair of women with shining jewels, or those wrapped around the curved arm of the small, delicately-tuned lute presented to bards who stroke its strings. In this small, impoverished village of dry wasteland, the young warrior, who destroys any enemy who dares look at him, urges his horse forward. If one were to count the male elephants he has slain with his spear, even the stars in the rising sky and the drops of cool rain would not be enough to match their number.","modern":"நெருப்புப் பிடித்த மூங்கில் வெடிப்பது போல ஓடி, தாவித் குதிக்கும் குதிரையானது பூ போன்ற அணிகலன்களை அணிந்துள்ளது. விளங்கும் அணிகலன்களை அணிந்த மகளிரின் கூந்தலில் சூடப்படும் நரந்தம் என்னும் வாசனைப் புல்லால் ஆன பல இழைகளைக் கொண்ட மாலையைப் போலவும், கைகளால் நரம்புகளை வருடி வாசிக்கும் பாணர்களுக்குக் கொடையாகக் கொடுக்கப்படும் வளைந்த தண்டை உடைய சிறிய யாழில் சுற்றப்பட்ட மாலை போலவும் அக்குதிரையின் பூக்கள் விளங்குகின்றன. வளம் குறைந்த இயல்புடைய கரம்பை நிலத்துச் சிற்றூரில் வாழும், தன்னை எதிர்த்துப் பார்க்கும் பகைவரைக் கொல்லும் இளங்காளை போன்ற அவ்வீரன், தன் குதிரையைச் செலுத்தித் தன் வேலால் கொன்ற ஆண் யானைகளைத் திரும்பத் திரும்ப எண்ணிப் பார்த்தால், வானத்தில் தோன்றும் விண்மீன்களின் எண்ணிக்கையும், குளிர்ந்த மழையின் துளிகளின் எண்ணிக்கையும் கூட அதற்கு இணையாகப் போதாது.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the tumpai tiṇai (warfare) and the theme kutirai maṟam (the valor of the horse/warrior). The poet, Veṟipāṭiya Kāmak Kaṇṇiyār, praises a young warrior from a poor, dry wasteland village (karampai cīṟūr). The warrior's horse is described as running with the speed and crackle of burning bamboo, adorned with beautiful flower-like ornaments. These ornaments are compared to the fragrant garlands worn by women or wrapped around the small lutes (cīṟiyāḻ) gifted to bards. The poet highlights the warrior's immense valor by stating that the number of enemy elephants he has slain with his spear is so vast that even the stars in the sky and the drops of rain are not enough to match it.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}